About us &nbsp;

Riverlane’s&nbsp;mission is to master quantum error correction (QEC) and unlock a new age of human progress. From advances in material and climate science, to complex chemistry simulation for new drug design, quantum computers will help humanity solve some of its most important challenges. But without QEC, the industry’s defining technical challenge, such breakthroughs can never be achieved.&nbsp;Riverlane is the world leader in QEC technology.&nbsp; It’s a complex problem that requires a range of skills,&nbsp;talent&nbsp;and passion.&nbsp;&nbsp;

Having raised more than $125M in funding to date to accelerate our&nbsp;cutting-edge&nbsp;R&amp;D in quantum error correction (QEC), Riverlane partners with many of the world’s leading quantum hardware providers and governments to make fault-tolerant quantum computing a reality.&nbsp;We’re&nbsp;making remarkable progress and growing fast

&nbsp;

About the role

We are looking for an exceptional Product Marketing Manager with experience in open-source software growth and adoption to lead product marketing for Deltakit , our open-source SDK for learning and adopting QEC.

Deltakit is just over a year old. It has had a strong start with a steadily growing developer community and growing end-user adoption. But it’s still early days. Your mission is to make Deltakit the platform the world experiments with and adopts for quantum error correction.

Deltakit is both a standalone software platform and the software we ship as the front end to our QEC hardware
